(0, 1) & \text{if } i \bmod 2 = 0 \\
(0, 0) & \text{if } i \bmod 2 = 1
\end{cases}
\end{align*} The final position is $(5, 10)$. The slope of the line is $m = \frac{10 - 10}{5 - 0} = 0$ and the y-intercept is $10$. Thus the equation of the line is $y = 10$. \end{think} <answer> $y = 10$ </answer>
